+## Consent
+
+The browser SDK starts opted out and storing nothing, and captures only once the visitor's
+tracking setting is `enabled`; the Worker drops every event of a user whose setting is
+`disabled`. Who decides what, per region, is in [privacy](privacy.md#tracking-consent).
+
